{
 "format": "house_ai.verify.actions/1",
 "about": "VERIFY_HARDENING 10.1 command classes of every registered action, generated once from the action registry (WP6, scratch gen_actions.py) and reviewed: PERCEPTION (sensing and the robot's own memory: B13 removes them, gating never needs them), NAVIGATION (the robot's own motion, posture and motion modes), COMM (speech, reports, alerts and alarms), DEPOSIT (setting a held thing or what a container holds at a destination: B3 swaps the destination, B6 undoes it by fetch + put), WAIT; everything else EFFECT. B2 keeps PERCEPTION, NAVIGATION, COMM and WAIT and drops EFFECT and DEPOSIT; open and close of a door or gate that go_room / approach / goto issued on the way are NAVIGATION in a trace (house_sim/tasks/battery/trace.py command_class). Social acts with an effect (sign_for, place_order, wake, evacuate), edits of the household's lists and logs (add_to_list, log_fault, ...) and standing orders (watch, run_pending, undo) are EFFECT. Read by house_sim/tasks/perceive.py command_class and the battery; tests/test_battery.py checks that every registered action has a class.",
